# "Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped": Faithless Looting
# puts Hired Blade (mana value 3, exactly the limit) and Questing Beast (mana value 4, one over) into Bot1's graveyard.
# Questing Beast is refused as a target and Hired Blade, the positive control for the same cast, is returned
# tapped (CR 115.1, 601.2c, 110.2a, 614.1c); Questing Beast stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Hired Blade
Questing Beast
Faithless Looting
Helping Hand
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Hired Blade; Questing Beast)
! Bot1.Hand.Helping Hand.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Questing Beast)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Helping Hand.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Hired Blade)
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Hired Blade
Bot1.Battlefield.Hired Blade.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Helping Hand; Faithless Looting; Questing Beast
